<div class="page-header"><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">About the portal</div><h1>Simple job searching, without the clutter.</h1><p>A focused project for connecting candidates with available opportunities.</p></div></div>
<main class="container section-space"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="form-card h-100"><div class="section-kicker">Our purpose</div><h2 class="section-title mt-2">A straightforward place to discover jobs.</h2><p class="muted-text mt-3">Job Portal brings together job listings, candidate profiles, and a simple application workflow. Users can search openings, save roles, submit applications, and follow their application status.</p><p class="muted-text">Administrators can publish, update, and remove job postings and review candidate applications.</p></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-12"><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i></div><h3>Find relevant roles</h3><p>Use the existing location and category filters to narrow your search.</p></div></div><div class="col-12"><div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i></div><h3>Keep track</h3><p>Save interesting jobs and monitor submitted applications from your dashboard.</p></div></div></div></div></div></main><%@include file="all_component/footer.jsp"%></body></html>
